{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KUROMAKU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VHS-style psychological thriller inspired by <i>Fears to Fathom</i> and <i>Chilla\u2019s Art</i>. Ordinary routines become your only defense against a creeping, unseen horror in this slow-burn 1990s-inspired thriller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kuromaku is a narrative-focused first-person horror experience built around isolation, domestic realism, and psychological tension. Rather than relying on constant spectacle, the game draws fear from silence, subtle environmental shifts, and the growing feeling that something inside the house is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kuromaku</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience centered around immersion, exploration, and player-driven outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/extras/41a7ccb23ac201f06425d9cc8959a86d.avif?t=1774621844\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Modes</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode</strong> \u2013 Recommended for first-time players.<br>Designed to provide a smoother experience with reduced difficulty, allowing players to focus on the story, atmosphere, and exploration without excessive challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013Intended for players who want to dive deeper into the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best suited for those aiming to explore different endings or for players who enjoy dialogues, reading, and uncovering every layer of the story.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/extras/6027bef837bab64fc30ae11a9f6779d7.avif?t=1774621844\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Dual Visual Modes</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 Clean, immersive presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Mode</strong> \u2013 Optional retro analog filter inspired by 1990s camcorder footage, featuring grain, distortion, and signal interference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/extras/d2a9d180818dd7b6b6599c023a47f2e5.avif?t=1774621844\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Everyday Routines, Twisted</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress time by completing grounded household tasks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning the bathroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Washing dishes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying groceries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintaining daily responsibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more routine life becomes, the more unsettling the changes feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/extras/9ddb0a3126731ffb649e09f74ba0d605.avif?t=1774621844\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Exploration &amp; Environmental Storytelling</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house and surrounding areas. Examine objects. Pay attention to subtle details. The environment evolves over time, revealing clues and hidden implications. Lighting, ambient sound, and environmental tension shift across the three days, transforming safe domestic spaces into oppressive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/extras/9a530324a1a404bd9f312eaf34c6e0d4.avif?t=1774621844\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices lead to different conclusions.<br>Not every truth is meant to be uncovered. Your reactions determine how events unfold.<br>Confront the presence. Ignore it. Investigate further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision influences the final outcome.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start The Game On Any Difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/5ab3bd6ab686881186622e340d37abfcf7e14617.jpg"},{"name":"Expose Mom's Secrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/5c573a1500afe94d8477eb13252de9e9098bfd97.jpg"},{"name":"Some Old Wisdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/7d5a3c3a1e1b4236e452ba2eabc450fbe20386df.jpg"},{"name":"Save Mom From Dad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/b4ae5c8a6d078b39705ae7236d6497668b391e20.jpg"},{"name":"Stop Dad From Making a Mistake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/29b25d159dd6c7fd8972d720532fec5419139005.jpg"},{"name":"I Failed Everyone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/548a2a0de9086e62254635614763ff79da633a34.jpg"},{"name":"I Love Music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947910/46521d1f5e2b12edeb468f67d88e011fb1077d20.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947910?t=1774621844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/a0e11affa621914a545a0a883776270fa9ae9006/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774621844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.