09f74ba0d605.avif?t=1774621844\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Exploration &amp; Environmental Storytelling</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house and surrounding areas. Examine objects. Pay attention to subtle details. The environment evolves over time, revealing clues and hidden implications. Lighting, ambient sound, and environmental tension shift across the three days, transforming safe domestic spaces into oppressive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/extras/9a530324a1a404bd9f312eaf34c6e0d4.avif?t=1774621844\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices lead to different conclusions.<br>Not every truth is meant to be uncovered. Your reactions determine how events unfold.<br>Confront the presence. Ignore it. Investigate further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision influences the final outcome.</p></li></ul>","developers":["BabGamesStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947910/f35afa1dc1ba8fbcba0287ca75bec6d1e27dabbe/header.jpg?t=1774621844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3947910/1340703636/94f16307a8063be3e395bb22868f7e9f0803471a/1774593203/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774594388","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3947910/1340703636/94f16307a8063be3e395bb22868f7e9f0803471a/1774593203/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774594388","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3947910/1340703636/94f16307a8063be3e395bb22868f7e9f0803471a/1774593203/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774594388",